OL,3,GNEWSAHollywood star 'sends love' to
OL,4,Amums helping SEND kids
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founders of a specialist centre for
OL,7,Fneurodivergent children have spoken of
OL,8,Ftheir joy after a Hollywood star sent
OL,9,Fthem a gift to mark the venue's
OL,10,Fopening.
OL,12,FLindsay Foskett and Jade McCloskey said
OL,13,Fthey "screamed" when a large bouquet of
OL,14,Fflowers sent by actor Colin Farrell
OL,15,Farrived at the opening of NEST Coventry
OL,16,Fon Friday.
OL,18,FThey contacted him last year after
OL,19,Flearning about his disability and
OL,20,Fneurodiversity campaign work. Farrell's
OL,21,Fson, James, has the neurogenetic
OL,22,Fcondition Angelman Syndrome.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
