OL,3,GNEWSAHollywood star 'sends love' to
OL,4,Amums helping SEND kids
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarrell sent a handwritten note
OL,7,Freading: 'To Lindsay and Jade and all
OL,8,Fthe good folks at Nest. Here's to an
OL,9,Famazing start and to many years of joy
OL,10,Fand life affirming care. Sending all my
OL,11,Flove, Colin Farrell'.
